{"id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-category.md","title":"Category","display":"df-category — Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-category","aliases":["58-df-category","Category Theory","Category"],"display":"df-category — Category","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-category</span><span>Category Theory</span><span>Category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category — Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded category datum)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (set-coded category predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(s,M,O)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(t,M,O)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in M\\times M:t(f)=s(g)\\},M\\right)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(e,O,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(s(e(A))=A\\land t(e(A))=A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f,g,h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\nc(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(s,M,O)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(t,M,O)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in M\\times M:t(f)=s(g)\\},M\\right)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(e,O,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(s(e(A))=A\\land t(e(A))=A\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f,g,h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\nc(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land \\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The components of the category datum are existentially unpacked from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>; no source, target, composition, or identity map remains as a hidden free parameter.</li>\n<li>Category: objects with morphisms, composition, identities</li>\n<li>Functor: structure-preserving map between categories</li>\n<li>Natural transformation: map between functors</li>\n<li>Limits and colimits: universal objects</li>\n<li>Adjoint functors: best approximation to inverse</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(s,M,O)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(t,M,O)\\\\\n&\\land \\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,\\{\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in M\\times M:t(f)=s(g)\\},M\\right)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(e,O,M)\\\\\n&\\land \\forall A\\in O\\;\\bigl(s(e(A))=A\\land t(e(A))=A\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land \\forall f,g\\in M\\;\\Bigl(t(f)=s(g)\\to\ns(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=s(f)\\land t(c(\\langle g,f\\rangle))=t(g)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land \\forall f,g,h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nt(f)=s(g)\\land t(g)=s(h)\\to\nc(\\langle h,c(\\langle g,f\\rangle)\\rangle)=c(\\langle c(\\langle h,g\\rangle),f\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land \\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\nc(\\langle e(t(f)),f\\rangle)=f\\land c(\\langle f,e(s(f))\\rangle)=f\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1860,"backlinks":[{"id":"66aa5f48849ca448","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle$ (the category datum used by [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])"},{"id":"b3c68757beeea68b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b4cc773d6acdba5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-category]])"},{"id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7efc508a5e5ea3ad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])"},{"id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])"},{"id":"f798fc3990a5c443","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Category}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"9a02fd87820572ba","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])"},{"id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])"},{"id":"